OL,3,GNEWSAFirst cases of bovine TB found in 
OL,4,AUK beavers                             
OL,6,FBovine tuberculosis (bTB) has been     
OL,7,Frecorded in beavers in the UK for the  
OL,8,Ffirst time, officials have confirmed.  
OL,10,FThe Animal and Plant Health Agency     
OL,11,F(APHA) said Mycobacterium bovis, the   
OL,12,Fbacteria which caused the disease, was 
OL,13,Ffound in two dead, wild beavers in     
OL,14,Fsouth-west England via Natural         
OL,15,FEngland's wildlife surveillance        
OL,16,Fprogramme.                             
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
