OL,3,GNEWSAFirst cases of bovine TB found in 
OL,4,AUK beavers                             
OL,6,FThe first case was detected in autumn  
OL,7,F2026 and a review of post-mortem       
OL,8,Freports from spring 2025 highlighted   
OL,9,Fthe second, the Department for         
OL,10,FEnvironment, Food and Rural Affairs    
OL,11,F(Defra) added.                         
OL,13,FIt noted the cases were isolated,      
OL,14,Findependent and there was no evidence  
OL,15,Fbeavers increase the risk of bTB       
OL,16,Ftransmission to livestock, other       
OL,17,Fwildlife or people.                    
